    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><paragraph>Positive for the concerns in the history of present illness. Alert and fully oriented; humorous and engaged; speech soft and slow but fluent and coherent; MoCA 27 of 30. Mood good; PHQ-9 score 3; no hallucinations or delusions. No other systems reported as affected in this synthetic episode. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
